\title{PrevalentNewUser: Prevalent New-User Cohort Design for OMOP CDM Data}
\description{
Implements the prevalent new-user (PNU) cohort design (Suissa et al. 2017 \doi{10.1002/pds.4117}) for data in the OMOP Common Data Model. The PNU design allows the reference treatment group to have already been exposed when index dates are defined, complementing CohortMethod which implements the active-comparator new-user design.
